        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: വികസനം",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വികസനം — vikasanaṁ — \"development\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഗ്രാമത്തിന്റെ വികസനത്തിന് പണം വേണം. grāmattinṟe vikasanattinŭ paṇaṁ vēṇaṁ. The village needs money for its development."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of a village, a town or a country: ഗ്രാമവികസനം, rural development."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വികസനം (vikasanaṁ) is built on the Sanskrit root vi-kas, \"to open, to expand\", whose noun vikāsa means \"budding; expansion, growth\" (Monier-Williams). Development is a flower opening."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
